#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/jit/adapter/base/index.rst:60
msgid ""
"torch's caching allocator orders reuse of a block only after earlier work on "
"the stream the block was allocated on, so tensors written by a kernel "
"launched on ``stream`` are allocated on ``stream``. ``None`` means the "
"launch stream is the current stream, where a plain ``torch.empty`` is "
"already correct."
msgstr ""

